{
	"title": "Colorie une fraction unitaire de la figure",
	"description": "Colorier 1/2 à 1/10 d'une bande, d'un disque ou d'une grille",
	"grades": ["CE1"],
	"theme": "Fractions",
	"domain": "Apprivoiser",
	"subdomain": "Partage",
	"level": 7,
	"delay": 90,
	"status": "draft",
	"options": {
		"constraints": {
			"reducedFractions": "off"
		}
	},
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "Colorie $\\frac{1}{{{d}}}$ de la figure.\n\n```partage\nforme: {{if:k==0|bande|disque}} {{d}}\ncolorier: 1/{{d}}\n```",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "k",
					"expression": "0..1"
				},
				{
					"name": "j",
					"expression": "1..7"
				},
				{
					"name": "d",
					"expression": "{{if:j==1|2|{{if:j==2|3|{{if:j==3|4|{{if:j==4|5|{{if:j==5|6|{{if:j==6|8|10}}}}}}}}}}}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"**La figure est partagée en ${{d}}$ parts égales** : une part, c'est $\\frac{1}{{{d}}}$ de la figure, un {{if:d==2|demi|{{if:d==3|tiers|{{if:d==4|quart|{{if:d==5|cinquième|{{if:d==6|sixième|{{if:d==8|huitième|dixième}}}}}}}}}}}}.",
					"On colorie $\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{1}$ part, n'importe laquelle."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Colorie $\\frac{1}{{{d}}}$ de la figure.\n\n```partage\nforme: grille 2×{{c}}\ncolorier: 1/{{d}}\n```",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "c",
					"expression": "2..5"
				},
				{
					"name": "d",
					"expression": "eval:2*c"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"**La figure est partagée en $2 \\times {{c}} = {{d}}$ parts égales** : une part, c'est $\\frac{1}{{{d}}}$ de la figure, un {{if:d==2|demi|{{if:d==3|tiers|{{if:d==4|quart|{{if:d==5|cinquième|{{if:d==6|sixième|{{if:d==8|huitième|dixième}}}}}}}}}}}}.",
					"On colorie $\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{1}$ part, n'importe laquelle."
				]
			}
		}
	],
	"testSpecs": [
		{
			"description": "1/5 : une part",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"k": "0",
				"j": "4"
			},
			"answers": ["3"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "correct"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Erreur : 4 parts (les autres)",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"k": "0",
				"j": "4"
			},
			"answers": ["1, 2, 3, 4"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "incorrect"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Erreur : 5 parts (toute la figure)",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"k": "0",
				"j": "4"
			},
			"answers": ["1, 2, 3, 4, 5"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "incorrect"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Rien colorié : case vide",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"k": "0",
				"j": "4"
			},
			"answers": [""],
			"expected": {
				"status": "empty"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "1/8 sur une grille 2×4 : une part",
			"variationIndex": 1,
			"variables": {
				"c": "4"
			},
			"answers": ["6"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "correct"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Erreur : 2 parts (une par ligne)",
			"variationIndex": 1,
			"variables": {
				"c": "4"
			},
			"answers": ["1, 5"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "incorrect"
			}
		}
	]
}
